source: Core Rule
description: >
  Saiyan Soul's third effect, as a Maneuver: up to 2 Battle Born stacks moved from one Combat Roll to another.
text: >
  (3)-[2/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, move up to 2 of your Battle Born stacks applied to a Combat Roll to another Combat Roll of your choice.

